# cv-api REST Client
# Switch environment: status bar (bottom right), Cmd+Alt+E (Mac), Ctrl+Alt+E (Win/Linux), or F1 → "Rest Client: Switch Environment"
# Environments: local | fly
# /lighthouse uses LIGHTHOUSE_URL from server .env. Do not set it to a page that renders Lighthouse results.

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### GitHub stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/github/stats
Accept: application/json

### Lighthouse scores (cached ~24h per Fly machine; first GET after cold start is slow)
GET {{baseUrl}}/lighthouse
Accept: application/json

### Clear Lighthouse cache on this machine only — then GET /lighthouse refetches PageSpeed (slow). With 2+ machines, repeat or wait for TTL.
POST {{baseUrl}}/lighthouse/invalidate
